{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "N44n0019_p0019a06"}
{"id": null, "n": "0134004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0134004", "type": "mod", "text": "證果（phalasacchikiriyā）在底本有「證道」magga。為誤植，依暹羅本改正。（CBETA 按：漢譯南傳大藏經此頁中缺相對應之註標[04]，今於此處加上[04]之註標。）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001001", "type": "orig", "text": "俱存論（yuganandha-kathā）「俱存」者，名為寂止、正觀。此以下稱為「俱存品」，只採用部分之名以為品名。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001002", "type": "orig", "text": "瞿私多園（Ghosītārāma）於 PTS. Dic 亦有 Ghositā。在暹羅本及底本皆有 sī。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0001003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0001003", "type": "orig", "text": "在底本有「阿羅漢得」（arahattapattiṁ）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0007004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0007004", "type": "orig", "text": "雖言十六行相實則列舉十七。但見下文最後之三未詳說。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011005", "type": "orig", "text": "雖言十六行相以上列舉之處成為十四。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0011006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0011006", "type": "orig", "text": "傾心底本雖作 āpajjati 在隨暹羅本為 āvajjati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0029001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0029001", "type": "orig", "text": "無願之義云云 底本脫落此一句，依暹羅本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0030002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0030002", "type": "orig", "text": "現前解底本暹羅本雖均作為 abhiropana- 如其他之用例應改為 abhiniropana-。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0031003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0031003", "type": "orig", "text": "退轉在底本雖有「識之義」依於暹羅本及其他用例改正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0031004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0031004", "type": "orig", "text": "地之義底本雖作「等之義」依其他之用例及暹羅本改正為 bhummaṭṭha。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0031005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0031005", "type": "orig", "text": "善解脫在底本雖有「善清淨」依暹羅本及其他之用例改正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0031006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0031006", "type": "orig", "text": "覺底本雖有 bhuñjana，依暹羅本及其他之用例應改正為 bujjhana。以下倣此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0032007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0032007", "type": "orig", "text": "足底本雖作 padaha 依暹羅本及其他之用例改正為 pāda- 其次思惟之足亦同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0035008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0035008", "type": "orig", "text": "住之次，底本有 vacanaṁ 異本有 cavanaṁ, caraṁ 等語以在文脈上應為不須要故不譯。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0036009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0036009", "type": "orig", "text": "有量、徧纏底本雖作 pamāṇabandhā，依暹羅本改為 pamāṇavantā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041001", "type": "orig", "text": "尊者 ariya 或被思考指為阿利安族。非尊者準此可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0041002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0041002", "type": "orig", "text": "墮者（vinipātika）vinipāta 即謂在地獄等之墮者。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0042003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0042003", "type": "orig", "text": "信根徧習在底本雖有 saddhindriyaṁ paribhāvitā，但隨暹羅本應讀為 saddhindriyaparibhāvitā。以下倣此。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0047004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0047004", "type": "orig", "text": "此之省略文準第四項乃至第七項可知。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0061001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0061001", "type": "orig", "text": "以上已於「轉法輪經」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0064002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0064002", "type": "orig", "text": "以上，已於別經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0065003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0065003", "type": "orig", "text": "已於第二之別經。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0069004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0069004", "type": "orig", "text": "以上已列舉五。應「脫一切智智」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0077001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0077001", "type": "orig", "text": "「吞」底本、暹羅本皆作 Paccāgamanti，改正為 Paccācamanti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0078001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0078001", "type": "orig", "text": "審慮力底本作 nijjhanti，應採用暹羅本之 nijjhatti。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0081002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0081002", "type": "orig", "text": "此之一句底本脫落。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0085003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0085003", "type": "orig", "text": "隨順（ninna）Mvyut, 30, 3 及參照註記。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0085004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0085004", "type": "orig", "text": "趣向（poṇa）Mvyut, 30, 4 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0085005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0085005", "type": "orig", "text": "臨入（pabbhāra）Mvyut, 30, 4 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0085006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0085006", "type": "orig", "text": "明所成底本雖為 vijāmayā，乃為 vijjāmayā 之誤植。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0086007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0086007", "type": "orig", "text": "勝羣處（āsabhaṁ ṭhanaṁ），Mvyut, 245, 716 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0087008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0087008", "type": "orig", "text": "非一底本之 anekavidita 乃為 anekavihita 之誤植。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0091001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0091001", "type": "orig", "text": "底本脫「想」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0099002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0099002", "type": "orig", "text": "底本 udāna 為 uddāna 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100001", "type": "orig", "text": "無等慧底本暹羅本雖俱作 assāmantapaññaṁ，但在 Mvyut. 48, 36 有語成為 asamaprajña（adi）以適合於今之文而採用。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0100002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0100002", "type": "orig", "text": "捷慧 hāsapaññā 與所謂之 āśuprajña 相等。（Mvyut. 48, 36 參照）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0107003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0107003", "type": "orig", "text": "此下在底本有重複文，依暹羅本改正之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0108004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0108004", "type": "orig", "text": "第八人（aṭṭhamaka）指由阿羅漢數住於第八者，位於善異生與預流者之中間。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0109005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0109005", "type": "orig", "text": "隨從在底本雖有 pacchā samannāgatā，今採用在暹羅本中有 pacchāgatā。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111006", "type": "orig", "text": "在別本有「所問」其義亦通。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111007", "type": "orig", "text": "超越在底本及暹羅本雖有 atighaṁsitvā（cati+ghars？），意義不明，今依別本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0111008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0111008", "type": "orig", "text": "於原文以下之五語（niddiṭṭhakāraṇā upakkhitakā te Bhagavato Sampajjanti）未詳。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0114009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0114009", "type": "orig", "text": "已在如註[02]所言在此處 hāsapañña 雖為 āśuprajñā 之轉成，而今見為 harṣaprajñā 使「捷」通於「喜」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0115010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0115010", "type": "orig", "text": "除底本於此處及以下雖作 vimodeti，但依暹羅本此為 vinodeti 之誤。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0115011", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0115011", "type": "orig", "text": "不忍在底本有 vāseti 成為 nādhivāseti 之誤植。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0116012", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0116012", "type": "orig", "text": "宿緣（pubbayoga）與所謂之宿業同。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0116013", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0116013", "type": "orig", "text": "開展在底本雖作 pabhijjhati，依暹羅本應採用 pabhijjati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0118014", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0118014", "type": "orig", "text": "獨等覺者（paccekasambuddha）同於所謂獨覺。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0120001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0120001", "type": "orig", "text": "徧流 visavitā 未詳。今只依 vi+sru 所見之說。D. II. 213 之 visaritā 參照。恐非為「神境」（rddhi-）viṣaya 之轉訛耶？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0121002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0121002", "type": "orig", "text": "動轉 ijjhati 在此處使之通於 iñjati。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0122003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0122003", "type": "orig", "text": "多端底本之 anekaviditaṁ 為 -vihitaṁ 之誤植。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0125004", "type": "orig", "text": "有色底本暹羅本雖俱有 rūpam，應改為 rūpiṁ。（就本註及次註 D. I, P. 77 其他參照）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0125005", "type": "orig", "text": "具一切之支節底本及暹羅本之 sabbaṅga-paccaṅgaṁ 應改為 -paccaṅgiṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0125006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0125006", "type": "orig", "text": "使諸根圓滿底本雖為 abhinindriyaṁ，但無寧採用暹羅本之 ahinindriyaṁ。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0126007", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0126007", "type": "orig", "text": "象〔軍〕底本之 hatthivaṇṇaṁ vā 應依暹羅本改為 hatthiṁ pi。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0127008", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0127008", "type": "orig", "text": "底本在此之下雖為「定遍滿神通……乃至……」，若如此之返覆之句存在「……乃至……」則成為「衍」〔繁復眾多〕，見暹羅本。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0128009", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0128009", "type": "orig", "text": "界（dhātu）在此處應見「慈」之類語。DA. I. 253 參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0129010", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0129010", "type": "orig", "text": "此之五人底本暹羅本俱只舉四人。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0131001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0131001", "type": "orig", "text": "此一句在底本脫落，今依暹羅本補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0132002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0132002", "type": "orig", "text": "在底本暹羅本俱缺此一句，依下文及其他個處之用語補之。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0134003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0134003", "type": "orig", "text": "散亂者在底本有「無散亂者」，依暹羅本改正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0134004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0134004", "type": "orig", "text": "證果（phalasacchikiriyā）在底本有「證道」magga。為誤植，依暹羅本改正。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0135001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0135001", "type": "orig", "text": "圓滿因緣暹羅本作舍衛國因緣。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0136002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0136002", "type": "orig", "text": "於最捨轉變Mvyut. 40, 9（神氏編 975）參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0138003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0138003", "type": "orig", "text": "此處缺十二依止之說明。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0142001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0142001", "type": "orig", "text": "以下至本論之終乃與大品第四根論二八中之文一致。（漢譯南傳藏四三．第四根論-二五節以後參照）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0146001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0146001", "type": "orig", "text": "本論與大品第一、智論第二十七章之文（參閱漢譯南傳藏四三、智論第二十七章-一六九頁）幾乎一致。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0152001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0152001", "type": "orig", "text": "在北傳此語，解為正性離生。見 Mvyut, 245, 98-100 與其之註記。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0154002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0154002", "type": "orig", "text": "死魔之餌之意。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0155003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0155003", "type": "orig", "text": "勝義 paramatthaṁ 在一本有 peramattaṁ，應譯為「勝性」又「勝我」？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0158001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0158001", "type": "orig", "text": "「無欲」之原語 nicchāta 恐由 na+iccha+tā 而成立，應為一形容詞之習慣語。（Saññata 參照）PTS，Dic，之說（nis+psāta）如何？"}
{"id": null, "n": "0159002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0159002", "type": "orig", "text": "存以（vijjati）說明為「明」（vijjā）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0161003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0161003", "type": "orig", "text": "漢譯南傳藏四三、大品第五解脫論十五節參照。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0018a1001", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0018a1001", "type": "add", "text": "觀【CB】，歡【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0038a0801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0038a0801", "type": "add", "text": "支【CB】，技【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0060a0601", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0060a0601", "type": "add", "text": "塵【CB】，麈【南傳】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0133a1401", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0133a1401", "type": "add", "text": "未【CB】，末【南傳】"}
